    "title": "'One Piece' teams up with Popeyes for meal, menu items fit for pirates",
    "text": "April 13, 2026Updated April 14, 2026, 1:03 p.m. ETPopeyes is teaming up with the Straw Hats to bring fans a \"One Piece\"-inspired menu featuring an entree, a drink, and even a dessert inspired by Tony Tony Chopper.Starting on Monday, April 13, fans of one of the most beloved anime will be able to chow down like the future King of the Pirates, as participating Popeyes restaurants across the U.S. and Canada introduce the Popeyes x One Piece menu for a limited time, according to a news release emailed to USA TODAY.On the day the menu unveils, a limited number of customers who purchase Popeyes Luffy Bento Bundle at select locations will receive official \"One Piece\" bento boxes for free.Here's what to know about Popeyes latest collab.What is on the Popeyes x One Piece menu?The following items are on the menu:Luffy Bento Box, $7.99- Includes two pieces of Popeyes Signature Chicken and mac and cheese.Gum-Gum Fruit Lemonade, $3.49- A lemonade inspired by the fictional \"Gum-Gum Fruit,\" the Devil Fruit that gave Captain Monkey D. Luffy his powers.Chopper’s Cupcake, $3.99- A pink cake with pink frosting named after the Straw Hat crew's doctor, Tony Tony Chopper.Luffy Bento Bundle, $13.99- The bundle includes pieces of Popeyes Signature Chicken, mac and cheese, a Gum-Gum Fruit lemonade, and Chopper’s CupcakeWhich locations will be giving away free bento boxes?A limited number of customers who purchase a Luffy Bento Box Bundle at these locations will receive a free collectible bento box:New York City - 1530 Broadway, New YorkBoston - 304 Squire Road, Revere, MassachusettsNew Brunswick - 571 Milltown Road, New JerseyChicago - 621 Ogden Ave., Downers Grove, IllinoisLos Angeles - 7635 Winnetka Ave., CaliforniaMiami Beach- 1427 Washington Ave., FloridaFans can also get Popeyes x One Piece merchOn Wednesday, April 15, Popeyes will also release exclusive Popeyes x One Piece merchandise, which includes keychains, T-shirts, and Bento Boxes, according to the news release. The merchandise will be available for purchase online at shop.popeyes.com.What is 'One Piece'?\"One Piece\" is a Japanese comic book, also known as a manga, created by Eiichiro Oda in 1997. Since its publication, it has been translated into multiple languages, including English. A Japanese animated show (anime), the Netflix live-action show, and multiple movies have also been created based on the manga.On Tuesday, March 3, Crunchyroll announced that the \"One Piece\" comic has sold over 600 million copies, surpassing Superman and becoming the best-selling comic book of all time.Oda is the eighth best-selling author of all time, and sits behind J. K. Rowling, who sold 600 to 650 million copies of the Harry Potter novels, according to Crunchyroll. Oda is also the only Japanese author and the second non-English-language author listed in the top 10.This story has been updated to include new information.Julia Gomez is a Trending reporter for USA TODAY and covers popular toys, space phenomena, scientific studies, natural disasters, holidays, and trending news. Connect with her on LinkedIn, X, Instagram, and TikTok: @juliamariegz, or email her at jgomez@gannett.com.",
